	(text "USB-C sink, 5 V only: CC1/CC2 5.1k to GND. D+/D- go straight to the S3's native USB\n(GPIO20/GPIO19): no USB-UART chip and no ESD chip (D9).\nJ6: XY308-2P screw terminal for external 5 V, e.g. a solar panel (D10; fitted from D34)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 68.58 102.87 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "053ca3d1-f30e-5dc8-bc3d-d742477edd0b")
	)
	(text "PROG: I = 1200 / R. 4.7k = 255 mA (default); bridge JP1 (2.35k) = 510 mA (D8).\nTEMP grounded: no cell thermistor. J4 (JST-PH, fitted from D34): pin 1 = cell -,\npin 2 = cell +. Not all JST-PH cells are wired the same way: check polarity (D11).\nXB5353A (D12) sits in the cell's negative lead: board GND is the pack's P-.\nTrips at 4.30 V / 2.4 V, 3 A discharge; C3 at its VDD pin."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 198.12 24.13 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "131d0c67-0ba8-5f8f-bb96-fbb0384eabed")
	)
	(text "ESP32-S3-WROOM-1U MODULE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 58.1683 149.735 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "14680cec-36f9-59d7-9a49-327d3d3b6aa0")
	)
	(text "Ra-01SH (L2): SX1262 with crystal, 803-930 MHz, IPEX socket for the antenna (pad 1 ANT unused).\nThe module drives its own RF switch from DIO2 (TXEN = DIO2 inside; RXEN not connected), so\nTXEN, RXEN, DIO2 and DIO3 are left open. Own always-on regulator U7 (+3V3_RF, L18): isolates the\nradio from WiFi load steps; LoRaMesher sleeps it over SPI, never by power. C14/C15 at pin 3, C16 at U7.\nR22 keeps the radio deselected and R23 keeps it out of reset while the ESP32 boots or sleeps.\nFirmware: LoRaMesher/RadioLib defaults fit (DC-DC regulator, no TCXO, DIO2 as RF switch) (L6)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 247.65 364.49 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "3bfcf3c4-b7d0-59ea-b1dc-3555a4967324")
	)
	(text "Fitted by default: J3 pin 2 = A, pin 3 = B via JP2/JP3 (D29). A board without Modbus can leave out\nU5, C13, R18-R21, D5 and J3 (see COST-ESTIMATE.txt). GPIO38 = DE/RE (high = transmit, R18 = receive).\nJP4 bridged = 120R termination. RS485 sensors need their own 5-24 V supply (external)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 66.04 369.57 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "4110b3de-13a4-576e-a121-e6401e78461d")
	)
	(text "USB-C: 5 V IN AND PROGRAMMING"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 58.42 16.6473 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "4b984261-86f1-57fe-ac4c-a62ed9a0bdbc")
	)
	(text "SYSTEM POWER: LOAD SHARING, 3.3 V LDO, SWITCHED SENSOR RAIL"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 346.71 16.385 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "6c0552ec-f9a9-5215-be19-91e292be9103")
	)
	(text "LORA RADIO: AI-THINKER RA-01SH (SX1262)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 239.9457 284.355 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "8b193079-af4d-5348-a8ae-06bc25f1cd8a")
	)
	(text "GPIO map (L3, L19): sensors 4/5 (ADC1) -> J2, spares 1/2 (ADC1) -> J13, VBAT_SENSE 6, I2C 17/18,\nLoRa NSS/SCK/MOSI/MISO 8-11, RST 12, BUSY 13, DIO1 14 (as Heltec V3/V4), nRAIL_EN 15,\nRS485 DE 38, UART0 43/44 -> RS485 or J3, USB 19/20, LED 21, BOOT 0.\nSpares 36, 39, 41, 42, 47, 48 -> J5 holes (L10, L19). Not connected: straps 3, 45, 46 (internal defaults)\nand 7, 16, 35, 37, 40. J7 (not fitted): off-board LED, pin 1 = anode, pin 2 = cathode, shares R13.\nC8/C9 close to module pin 2. U.FL antenna: module end at the board edge, away from the LoRa antenna (L5)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 74.93 255.27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "ac7f6af1-0b25-5601-9bba-06e5a403af88")
	)
	(text "RS485 / MODBUS (FITTED; OMIT TO SAVE COST)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 58.9232 284.355 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "baec95c8-e66d-52af-9271-608c081e3dce")
	)
	(text "J2 (main) and J3 share one layout, pins 1-10 (D4, D5); J2, J12, J3 and J13 all fitted (J2: S1/S2 = GPIO4/5, J3: GPIO1/2):\n  1 GND  2 SDA/A  3 SCL/B  4 3V3_SW  5 GND  6 S1/GPIO1  7 3V3_SW  8 GND  9 S2/GPIO2  10 3V3_SW\nEach is two XY308-2.54-5P blocks side by side (no 10-way part at JLCPCB): J2+J12, J3+J13.\nJP2/JP3: J3 pins 2-3 = RS485 A/B as delivered; cut 1-2 and bridge 2-3 for UART0 RX/TX (U5 must then be left off) (D29).\nJ5: holes only, no connector (L10): spare GPIO 36, 39, 41, 42, 47, 48 with GND; holes 4 and 6 unconnected and 3V3_SW. R16 (SENS1 pull-up) and C12 (SENS2 filter) fitted; R17, C11 not fitted.\nFirmware: switch +3V3_SW on (GPIO15 low) before any I2C or sensor access."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 250.19 248.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "cbcf1fde-5d49-5c38-bc09-6c498359e0ab")
	)
	(text "SENSOR CONNECTORS J2, J3 (FITTED) AND SPARE GPIO HOLES J5"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 245.11 149.735 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "d1c11c23-9cc7-58cd-ba22-a1029eb29508")
	)
	(text "D3 + Q1: with USB present VSYS comes through D3 and Q1 is off; without it Q1 turns on\nand the cell feeds VSYS. The charger never carries the load.\nU3 RT9080 (L18): 600 mA, 2 uA quiescent. VBAT_SENSE = VBAT / 2 (1M/1M, ~2 uA).\nQ2: nRAIL_EN (GPIO15) LOW = +3V3_SW on. R10 holds the rail off through reset and boot.\nTP1-TP7: probe pads on VBUS, VBAT, VSYS, +3V3, +3V3_SW, +3V3_RF and GND (L20)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 351.79 110.49 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "d4f3bdbe-bb8e-520a-91ec-a6d57a549378")
	)
	(text "LI-ION CHARGER & CELL PROTECTION"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 187.9491 16.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "dcee1550-e105-59b7-bfb2-54e9b86292a4")
	)
